## 9. AI Product Modules (Enterprise)

Platform phải có (không phải MVP stub):

1. Rule Engine (1000 rules từ DB)
2. Root Cause Graph Engine
3. Coaching Engine (top lỗi/điểm mạnh, role play, chấm lại)
4. Golden Call Benchmark
5. QA Calibration (AI vs Human score)
6. Appeal Workflow
7. Conversation DNA (radar strength/weakness/progress)
8. Revenue Leak AI (heatmap, funnel, Pareto, trend)
